<item><title>Senegal sends music delegation to Rabat to pursue export markets</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-sends-music-delegation-to-rabat-to-pursue-export-09a523/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-sends-music-delegation-to-rabat-to-pursue-export-09a523/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>About 30 music professionals attended Visa For Music, where Senegalese acts performed and representatives explored links with foreign industry players.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 06:05:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
